# discord-api-types is imported in src/services/*.ts for compile-time type guards
# and is no longer an unused dependency.
#
# ajv-formats is used in src/spec-contract.test.ts via createRequire (dynamic CJS interop)
# because its default export is a callable function that TypeScript cannot represent
# correctly as an ESM default import under "module: NodeNext". Depcheck cannot detect
# dynamic require() calls, so the package is explicitly listed here.
ignores:
  - ajv-formats
